meta {
  name: Preview what a plan change would lock
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/subscription/impact
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  What changes for this organization if it moves to another plan: the items over a limit that would be locked (with the first few named), the counts that stay but cannot grow, monitors that would check less often, and the features it would lose. Pass `plan_id` for a plan change, or leave it out to preview where the organization lands when its subscription ends. `lines` words the same changes in `locale` (en, nl, de or fr). Read-only; empty when nothing changes.

  Scope: `billing.read`
}
